      "pronunciationText": "Last video ended with this question. Mark one sigma either side of the mean. How much of the area lies between those marks? This curve has no simple area formula, so today a graphing calculator does the measuring. An orchard grades its apples by mass, and the masses are normal, with mean one hundred and fifty grams and standard deviation fifteen. Then we'll turn what we find into a rule you can use with no technology at all."
    },
