      "pronunciationText": "Back to the question. Ask the calculator for the area from one thirty-five to one sixty-five. It works out the area numerically: zero point six eight two seven. So in the model, about sixty-eight percent of apples land within one sigma. Widen the band to two sigma and it gives zero point nine five four five, and three sigma gives zero point nine nine seven three. If you use a calculator or app in an answer, say that you did."
