      "pronunciationText": "Heights of Year 12 students are normal, with mean one seventy centimetres and standard deviation eight. What percentage are between one sixty-two and one seventy-eight? That's eight either side, one sigma, so about sixty-eight percent. What percentage are taller than one eighty-six? That's two eights above, so two sigma. Outside two sigma is five percent, and half of that is above, so about two point five percent."
